abstract: >-
  GeoXVIEW is a scale-adaptive environmental exposure framework built on 1,400
  field sites across all 254 Texas counties (2023 to 2026). It combines air quality,
  land surface temperature and land cover into an Environmental Exposure Index (EEI),
  reports each component separately, and measures how the index changes across five
  map units (county, county subdivision, ZIP code, census tract, block group).
keywords:
